abstract: >-
  ZhiyouFormal v1.0 is the complete Lean 4 + Mathlib4 formal verification package
  accompanying Xiong Wei's three-volume theoretical trilogy (Continuous Ontology,
  Probability Cloud Evolution Theory, and Zhiyou Unified Theory). It contains 48
  machine-checked theorems, 4 explicit model-consistency constructions, and 4
  transparently declared external physical/analytic axioms, achieving zero unproved
  placeholders (0 sorry). Verified modules cover potential-difference conservation and
  decoherence gravity, discrete Fokker-Planck / projective collapse and Pearl do-calculus
  confounder separation, general-to-special convergence (dR/dt = Q - D), target-overlap
  inverted-U optimality, niche monotonicity, potential-difference three-price identity,
  and cross-disciplinary downward compatibility lemmas.
